'''Group 4 of the [[1962 FIFA World Cup]]''' took place from 30 May to 7 June 1962. The group consisted of [[Argentina national football team|Argentina]], [[Bulgaria national football team|Bulgaria]], [[England national football team|England]], and [[Hungary national football team|Hungary]].<ref name="RSSSF"/>

